{"availability":"available","full":"Integral2u/SharpMind","name":"SharpMind","description":"SharpMind. A pure C# / .NET LLM engine — inference, training, and agent tooling in one solution.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":68,"forks":7,"created":"2026-04-24T00:21:05Z","updated":"2026-10-11T04:10:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://integral2u.github.io/SharpMind/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.990Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.990Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.990Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:27.990Z","stars":68,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SharpMind. A pure C# / .NET LLM engine — inference and agent tooling in one solution.","SharpMind is an end-to-end LLM stack written entirely in C#, with no dependency on llama.cpp, PyTorch, or any native runtime for its core path. It loads GGUF models, runs quantized CPU inference with modern decoding acceleration (speculative + Medusa-style drafting), and — unusually for a C# inference engine — also includes its own autograd engine so you can fine-tune (LoRA), distill, and prune models in the same process that serves them. LoRA fine-tuning can optionally run on an NVIDIA GPU via a separate accelerator plugin (see GPU-accelerated training).","It ships as a set of composable libraries plus a terminal chat application (SharpMind.CUI) built on top of them."],"features":["No native runtime required. Tensor math, quantization kernels, and the training loop are all managed C#. Inference runs entirely on the CPU; GPU acceleration (via ILGPU/cuBLAS) is opt-in, training-only, and lives in its…","Runs models bigger than your RAM. A disk-streaming load mode pages transformer layers in and out during the forward pass instead of holding the whole model resident (details below).","Modern decoding, not just greedy/top-p. Both classic speculative decoding and Medusa-style multi-head speculative decoding are implemented from scratch, with careful KV-cache rollback on rejection.","A genuinely pluggable kernel system. Hardware-specific kernel variants (scalar/SSE/AVX2/FMA) are wired up at runtime through a small internal dispatch layer JigSawDotNet rather than hand-written if/switch ladders —…","Agent tooling included. Tool-calling, permission gating (Never / Ask / Always), and sub-agent orchestration ship in SharpMind.Inference.Agent."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Integral2u/SharpMind/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"3d4702a98e620ba300b63997b18024da96ab806d5a00816a3e308e1b9ec2da0a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:28.056Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:28.056Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SharpMind. A pure C# / .NET LLM engine — inference and agent tooling in one solution.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Integral2u/SharpMind/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3d4702a98e620ba300b63997b18024da96ab806d5a00816a3e308e1b9ec2da0a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Integral2u/SharpMind/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:28.057Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T04:10:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Integral2u/SharpMind/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:28.059Z","hash":"3d4702a98e620ba300b63997b18024da96ab806d5a00816a3e308e1b9ec2da0a","originalBytes":51148,"storedBytes":51148,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","models","sharpmind","chat","training","load","one","using","run","gguf","var","each","inference","per","weights","new","only","out","runs","tokenizer","decoding","engine","own","prompt","same","token","before","data","kernel","loaded","loadmode.full","memory","plugin","rather","see","file","full","layer","loading","path","scalar","every","fma","llama.cpp","lora","output","quant","runtime","start","through","across","decode","get","hardware","ichatclient